            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">MOFCOM and five other departments, notice No. 74 of 2026 (18 May 2026) — wider store coverage, spot checks under ¥10,000, paperless processing</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202607/content_7075798.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">State Taxation Administration (July 2026) — refund-upon-purchase goes nationwide across regions from 1 September 2026; paperless filing, online-store pilot, national refund QR code</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://shanghai.chinatax.gov.cn/xwdt/ztzl/zcgll/ljts/zchb/201911/t449153.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">Shanghai Tax Bureau — "Departure Tax Refund Policy for Overseas Visitors" (bilingual; 11% / 8% rates, 2% agency fee, ¥20,000 cash limit)</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.globaltimes.cn/page/202512/1350012.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">Global Times — refund claims surge 285% in first 11 months (12,252 tax-refund shops nationwide, 7,000+ offering refund-upon-purchase)</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
